TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-math-0006111v2
AU  - Biane, Philippe
TI  - Approximate factorization and concentration for characters of symmetric groups
DA  - D:20210914
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0006111
AB  - We prove a factorization-concentration result for characters of symmet- ric groups. This is then applied to the asymptotic behaviour of the decomposition of the tensor representations. There are connections with the Pastur-Marcenko distri- bution of random matrix theory, and freely inﬁnitely divisible distributions.
